# macOS metadata sidecars.
._*
**/._*
.DS_Store

# Scratch files some .phpt tests write when run with this directory as cwd.
# Anchored to the root on purpose: a bare *.gz would hide committed test
# fixtures elsewhere in the tree.
/*.tmp
/*.gz
/readgzfile_temp/
/1x1.jpg
/DataFile*.txt
/EmptyFile*.txt
/*.dir/
/bug*_x/
